# Echo Map — locked baseline (env-onboarding, Jul 2026)

Shipped and working. Extend carefully; do not rewrite core flows without explicit ask.

## Product shape
- Tabs: **Map · My Echoes · Collection · Log**
- Meme/image is primary kind; audio/video optional
- Visibility: **world** (map + optional global browse), **friends** (fren = follow either direction), **private** (owner only)
- Pins hidden until discovered; bats show approximate areas until walk-in range

## Must preserve
- **Location**: auto-request on Map tab; `list_echoes_near` needs `userPos` (2.5 km cap)
- **Fren graph**: load both `followingIds` and `followerIds`; pass `{ followingIds, followerIds }` to `canDiscoverEcho` / `canHintEcho`
- **Focus deep-link**: consume `focusEchoId` once (`consumedFocusRef`); clear `?echo=` via `onClearEchoFocus` — never re-open modal on `echoes` refresh
- **Collection**: persist `mediaPath`, not signed URLs; refresh signed URLs on Collection tab; **Remove from collection** in modal + card menu
- **Exports**: keep `sortByDistance` in `echoRange.js` (build breaks if removed)
- **Realtime**: merge inserts via `getEchoById` + `refreshServerEchoes`; do not swallow fetch errors silently in dev

## SQL (Supabase, in order)
1. `supabase-patch-echoes.sql` + `supabase-patch-echoes-images.sql`
2. Echo browse patches `2a` → `2b` → `2c` → `2d`
3. `supabase-patch-echo-range.sql`, `supabase-patch-echo-aura.sql`, `supabase-patch-echoes-read.sql`
4. `supabase-patch-echo-publish-notify.sql` (notifications + Realtime + `get_echo`)

## UI cleanup (keep)
- No “stays until you delete” in echo view; delete only in Edit / owner menu
- World icon tap → city blur, or exact spot when **place name + 420m** range (`echoMapNavTarget`)
